-- Phase 3 of the NPC / bestiary work, first book: every species Rifts Conversion
-- Book One stats in its Faerie Folk and Palladium Monsters & Animals sections -
-- rows for creatures (migration 074) and their attacks in stat_attacks
-- (migration 073, owner_kind 'creature').
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration.
--
-- NOT HERE: the book's playable races (Bearmen, Wolfen, Giants, Goblins... printed
-- ~44-113) are R.C.C.s for the class pipeline, not creatures; the Kelpie's Faerie
-- entry is only a pointer to its monster entry; the Eandroth Rogues are
-- adjustments to the Eandroth, not species of their own.
--
-- EXTRACTED by nine book-extract-workers - a block belonging to the slice where
-- its heading is printed, so none fell between two - every number read off a
-- 200 dpi render rather than the OCR cache, which carries the digit cipher.
-- RECONCILED by book-reconcile against the renders, row by row; its corrections
-- are applied. An eight-word shingle check against the book's text caught prose
-- too close to it, which is reworded.
--
-- WHAT A ROW HOLDS. The book's DICE, as formulas in the one grammar of
-- js/creature-roll.js - every row here passes creatureFormulaGaps, the check the
-- regression suite runs on the live catalog. Where the book gives both an S.D.C.
-- and a Rifts Earth M.D.C. figure, the M.D.C. one is the formula and the other is
-- in pools_note; so is anything the grammar cannot say ("per level of
-- experience"). An intelligence the book gives only in words ("animal") is left
-- out rather than guessed. A floor the book prints ("I.Q., M.E. and P.S. never
-- lower than 17") is the grammar's "min N" - eighteen rows carry one. description and natural_abilities are short
-- paraphrases - no sentence is the book's.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/add-creatures-conversion-book-one.sql
--
-- BY CATEGORY:
--   faerie (22): Bogie, Brownie, Dead Moon Hag, Faerie: Common, Faerie: Green Wood,
--     Faerie: Night-Elves, Faerie: Silver Bells, Grogach, Hairy Jack, Leprechaun,
--     Nymph, Pixie: Common, Pixie: Frost, Puck, Spriggan, Sprite: Tree, Sprite: Water,
--     Sprite: Wind-Puffs, Toad Stools, Will-O-The-Wisp, Kelpie, Wing Tips
--   monster (32): Angel-Demon Serpent, Beast Dragon, The Boogie-Man, Bug Bears,
--     Centaurs, The Cyber-Horsemen of Ixion, Chimera, Dragon Wolf, Eye Killer,
--     Feathered Death, Gruunor, Harpies, Lizard Mage, Loogaroo, Manticore, Maxpary,
--     Melech, Peryton (Demon Deer), Shadow Stalker, Sphinx, Syvan, Unicorn, Weirdwing,
--     Taut: Blow Worms, Taut: Fire Worms, Taut: Nippers, Taut: Serpent Beasts, Taut:
--     Tri-Fang, Taut: Tomb Worms, Za, Zavor, Waternix
--   parasite (1): Chig - or P.P.E. Chig
--   animal (7): Devil Digger, Emirin, Gryphon, Owl-Thing, Pegasus, Scorpion Devil,
--     Silonar
--   magical beast (1): Drakin (The Luck Bird)
--   beast (1): Dragondactyl
--   humanoid (6): Eandroth, Grimbor, Gromek, Hytril, Palladium Lizard Men, Ratling
--   dragon (2): Ki-Lin, Sandwyrm
--   undead (3): Maxpary Shambler, Spectre, Yema
--   demon (1): Mucker
--   construct (1): Scarecrows

  'bogie', 'Bogie', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Lean toward Anarchist (30%), Miscreant (30%), Aberrant (30%)', '{"IQ":"2D6+1","ME":"2D6+1","MA":"2D6","PS":"1D6","PP":"3D6+6","PE":"3D6","PB":"1D6","Spd":"4D6"}', NULL, NULL, 'PEx3+4D6', '1D6x100', NULL, 'Spd is 4D6 running. PPE draws automatically from ambient sources (ley lines) without depleting its own, per general Faerie Folk trait. In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 10, 4D6 S.D.C., P.E. x3 for Hit Points.', NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":1,"dodge":2,"pull":3,"roll":2}', '+6 save vs Horror Factor, +2 on all saving throws. General Faerie Folk note: H.F. typically 8, not restated for Bogie.; attacks per melee: Four physical or two using magic; dodge: +2 (automatic, no melee action used); pull: +3 (pull punch); roll: +2 (roll with impact)', 'R.C.C.: Faerie Warrior and Scout. Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98%; PCs may learn 2 more languages at base+10%. Identify Plants & Fruit 75%, Holistic Medicine 45%, Land Navigation 80%, Wilderness Survival 85%, Track Animals 60%, Preserve Food 75%, Faerie Lore 85%, Sing 45%, Dance 75%, Prowl 77%, Climb 90%/80%, Acrobatics 65%, Swim 80%, Horsemanship 80%, and three ancient W.P.s of choice. Skills do not increase.', 'Nightvision 90 ft, sees invisible, keen normal sight, senses water (40%) and ley lines (55%), and can shapeshift into a large tarantula-sized spider, scorpion, or centipede.', 'Wind Rush, Fear, Wisps of Confusion, Purple Mist, Befuddle, Repel Animals, Ventriloquism, Globe of Daylight, Animate Objects', NULL, '8 inches tall (0.25 m)', '8 ounces (0.23 kg)', 'Effectively immortal; dies only if slain (per general Faerie Folk note)', 'Grasslands, forests, and swamps; odd, mysterious, or frightening places; lairs under rotting logs, hollow trees, animal burrows', 'gentler Faerie Folk (defends them); other Faerie Folk generally', 'Goblins; Toad Stools', NULL, 'Eight-inch insectoid trickster faerie fond of gold and drink, luring travelers into danger yet fiercely protective of gentler faerie kin.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.116-117');
  'brownie', 'Brownie', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Lean toward good; Principled (40%), Scrupulous (50%)', '{"IQ":"2D6+1","ME":"2D6","MA":"3D6+2","PS":"2D6+2","PP":"3D6","PE":"2D6","PB":"3D6+2 min 10","Spd":"4D6"}', NULL, NULL, 'PEx4+4D6', '1D6x100', NULL, 'P.B. has a minimum of 10. Spd is 4D6 running. In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 9, 4D6 S.D.C., P.E. x4 for Hit Points.', NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1}', '+2 on all saving throws. General Faerie Folk note: H.F. typically 8, not restated for Brownie.; attacks per melee: Four physical or two using magic', 'Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98%; PCs may learn 2 more languages at base+10%. Identify Plants & Fruit 85%, Land Navigation 85%, Wilderness Survival 95%, Preserve Food 85%, Cook 85%, Holistic Medicine 55%, Faerie Lore 85%, Sing 60%, Dance 70%, Gymnastics 50%, Swim 80%, Prowl 45%, Climb 60%/50%, Pick Pockets 50%, Pick Locks 40%, W.P. Blunt plus one of choice. Skills do not increase.', 'Nightvision 90 ft, keen normal sight and smell, senses water (50%), secret doors/compartments (40%), and ley lines (50%).', 'Mend Cloth, Mend Stone, Dowsing, Sleep, Animate Objects, Cure Minor Disorders, Purification', NULL, 'One to two feet tall (0.3-0.6 m)', '1D4x10 pounds (4.5-18 kg)', 'Around 5000 years or longer (per general Faerie Folk note)', 'Hollow trees, tree stumps, under porches, wells, plus usual Faerie habitats', 'the household or family it attaches to; other Faerie Folk generally', 'Banshees; most demons; the undead; Goblins; Hob-Goblins; Kobolds; Orcs', NULL, 'Shy, furred two-foot faerie who secretly helps a chosen household with chores, rewarded only with cream or honey.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.117');
  'dead-moon-hag', 'Dead Moon Hag', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Miscreant or Diabolic evil', '{"IQ":"2D6+4","ME":"2D6+4","MA":"2D6","PS":"3D6+4","PP":"2D6+4","PE":"3D6+4","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+4"}', NULL, NULL, 'PEx5+6D6', '1D6x100', NULL, 'M.D.C. and P.S. double on moonless nights, and double again while in giant form (see natural_abilities). In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 10, 6D6 S.D.C., P.E. x5 for Hit Points.', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":3,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":2}', '+8 save vs Horror Factor; impervious to disease; +2 on all saving throws.; attacks per melee: Three physical or three using magic; parry: +2 (automatic, like a parry); dodge: +2 (automatic, like a parry); pull: +2 (pull punch)', 'Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98% plus two more languages at base+20%. Identify Plants & Fruit 75%, Holistic Medicine 45% (surgeon 60%), Brew 80%, Cook 80%, Preserve Food 75%, Recognize/Use Poison 80%, Land Navigation 80%, Wilderness Survival 85%, Track Animals 75%, Faerie Lore 90%, Prowl 70%, Climb 70%/60%, Horsemanship: General 80%, W.P. Knife plus two of choice. Skills do not increase.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees invisible, senses disease/sickness (50%) and ley lines (40%); can grow into a super-strong 9-10 ft giant once nightly for one hour.', 'Fear, Wisps of Confusion, Purple Mist, Life Drain, Spoil, Sickness, Curse: Illness, Cure Illness, Detect Poison, Ventriloquism, Tongues, and jinxing a weapon/tool; GM may allow all Russian Spoiling Magic', NULL, '4 feet 6 inches to 5 feet (1.35-1.5 m)', '100 pounds (45 kg)', 'About two to three hundred years (per general Faerie Folk note)', 'Comes out mainly on dark, gloomy, or foggy nights, rarely by day', 'dark forces; Goblins; Hob-Goblins; Toad Stools; Pucks; Kinnie Ger; Kelpie; occasionally humans, demons, Deevils, Necromancers', NULL, NULL, 'Emaciated, black-hearted crone-faerie who spreads sickness and misery, growing into a giant nightly and strongest on moonless nights.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.118');
  'faerie-common', 'Faerie: Common', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Any, but lean toward Unprincipled (30%) and Anarchist (50%)', '{"IQ":"3D6","ME":"2D6","MA":"2D6+2","PS":"1D6","PP":"4D6","PE":"2D6","PB":"4D6+6 min 17","Spd":"3D6"}', NULL, NULL, '6D6+24', '1D6x100', NULL, 'P.B. has a minimum of 17. Spd is 3D6 running or 3D6x10+40 flying. In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 7, 4D6 S.D.C., P.E. x5 for Hit Points.', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', '+1 save vs magic.; attacks per melee: Three physical or two using magic; parry: +2 (in flight); dodge: +2 (in flight)', 'Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98%; PCs may learn 2 more languages at base+10%. Identify Plants & Fruit 75%, Land Navigation 82%, Wilderness Survival 90%, Preserve Food 90%, Track Animals 32%, Faerie Lore 90%, Sing 60%, Dance 70%, Prowl 60%, Climb 60%/50%, W.P. Knife, W.P. Archery/Targeting. Skills do not increase.', 'Flies and hovers, nightvision 90 ft, sees invisible, keen normal sight, senses water (50%) and ley lines (80%).', 'Charm, Love Charm, Cloud of Smoke, Sleep, Tongues, and the Faeries'' Dance', NULL, 'Six inches tall (0.15 m/152 mm)', 'Six ounces (0.25 kg)', 'Effectively immortal; dies only if slain', 'Bright sunlit secluded forests, meadows, grasslands with wildflowers/fruit, far from cities', 'other Faerie Folk; most dragons; spirits of light; Druids; nature spirits', 'Banshees; most demons; the undead; Goblins; Hob-Goblins; Kobolds; Orcs', NULL, 'Tiny six-inch butterfly-winged faerie, merry and mischievous, dwelling among wildflowers and forests far from cities.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.118-119');
  'faerie-green-wood', 'Faerie: Green Wood', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Any, but lean toward Anarchist (40%), Unprincipled (30%), Scrupulous (15%)', '{"IQ":"3D6","ME":"2D6","MA":"2D6","PS":"1D6","PP":"3D6+6","PE":"2D6","PB":"4D6+5 min 16","Spd":"3D6"}', NULL, NULL, '5D6+18', '1D6x100', NULL, 'P.B. has a minimum of 16. Spd is 3D6 running or 3D6x10+40 flying. In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 6, 4D6 S.D.C., P.E. x4 for Hit Points.', NULL, 8, '{"attacks":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', '+1 save vs magic.; attacks per melee: Three physical attacks or two using magic; parry: +2 (in flight); dodge: +2 (in flight)', 'R.C.C.: Creature of magic and nature/Faerie wilderness scout. Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98%; PCs may learn 2 more languages at base+10%. Identify Plants & Fruit 80%, Land Navigation 82%, Wilderness Survival 90%, Preserve Food 90%, Track Animals 62%, Faerie Lore 90%, Sing 50%, Dance 64%, Pick Pockets 50%, Prowl 80%, Climb 80%/70%, one ancient W.P. of choice. Skills do not increase.', 'Flies and hovers, nightvision 90 ft, sees invisible, keen normal sight, senses water (70%) and ley lines (80%).', 'Charm, Circle of Rain, Circle of Flame, Grow Plants, Animate Plants, Purification, Tongues, and the Faeries'' Dance', NULL, 'Six inches tall (0.15 m)', 'Six ounces (0.17 kg)', 'Effectively immortal; dies only if slain', 'Dense forested regions, plus usual Faerie habitats', 'other Faerie Folk; most dragons; spirits of light; Druids; nature spirits', 'Banshees; most demons; the undead; Goblins; Hob-Goblins; Kobolds; Orcs', NULL, 'Slim green-skinned forest faerie with dark butterfly wings, favoring green and yellow clothing, using tiny bows and knives.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.119-120');
  'faerie-night-elves', 'Faerie: Night-Elves', 'faerie', 'rifts', 0, 'Any, but lean toward Anarchist (40%) and Unprincipled (40%)', '{"IQ":"3D6","ME":"2D6","MA":"2D6","PS":"1D6","PP":"3D6+6","PE":"2D6","PB":"4D6+1 min 16","Spd":"3D6"}', NULL, NULL, '6D6+40', '1D6x100', NULL, 'P.B. has a minimum of 16. Spd is 3D6 running or 3D6x10+40 flying. In S.D.C.-rule settings: A.R. 8, 5D6 S.D.C., P.E. x6 for Hit Points.', NULL, 8, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', '+1 save vs magic, +2 save vs Horror Factor.; attacks per melee: Four physical attacks or two using magic; parry: +2 (in flight); dodge: +2 (in flight)', 'R.C.C.: Creature of magic and nature/Faerie warrior. Speaks Faerie and Gobblely 98%; PCs may learn 2 more languages at base+10%. Identify Plants & Fruit 80%, Land Navigation 82%, Wilderness Survival 90%, Preserve Food 90%, Track Animals 70%, Faerie Lore 90%, Sing 50%, Dance 54%, Pick Pockets 50%, Prowl 80%, Climb 80%/70%, W.P. Sword, W.P. Archery & Targeting, one ancient W.P. of choice. Skills do not increase.', 'Flies and hovers, nightvision 120 ft, sees invisible, keen normal sight, senses water (80%) and ley lines (80%).', 'Befuddle, Blinding Flash, Mend Wood, Mend Clay, Invisibility (simple), Turn Self into Mist, Tongues, and the Faeries'' Dance', NULL, 'Six inches tall (0.15 m/152 mm)', 'Six ounces (0.25 kg)', 'Effectively immortal; dies only if slain', 'Bright sunlit secluded forests, meadows, grasslands with wildflowers/fruit, far from cities', 'other Faerie Folk; most dragons; spirits of light; Druids; nature spirits', 'Banshees; most demons; the undead; Goblins; Hob-Goblins; Kobolds; Orcs', NULL, 'Dark grey-green, sword-carrying faerie, the most aggressive and combat-ready faerie kind, quick to defend its kin.', 'Rifts Conversion Book One p.119-120');
